@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"

actor User
participant "SettingsPage\n(Parent)" as Parent
participant "ConfidenceThreshold\n(Child)" as Child1
participant "ModelSelector\n(Child)" as Child2
participant "SettingsContext" as Context
database "LocalStorage" as LS

box "Backend (Django)" #f8f9fa
    participant "AIModelListAPIView" as ViewList
    participant "SwitchModelAPIView" as ViewSwitch
    database "SQLite" as DB
end box

== 1. 初期化フェーズ (Mount) ==

Parent -> ViewList: GET /api/models/
activate ViewList
ViewList -> DB: 全モデル取得
ViewList --> Parent: models[]
deactivate ViewList

Parent -> LS: getItem("appSettings")
LS --> Parent: 設定
Parent -> Context: setSettings(parsedData)


== 2. 信頼度下限の設定 (Client Side) ==

User -> Child1: スライダーを操作
Child1 -> Child1: setValue(localState)
Child1 -> Context: setSettings(newThreshold)
Context -> LS: setItem("appSettings", JSON)
Note right of LS: ブラウザを閉じても\n設定が維持される

== 3. 使用モデルの切り替え (Server Side) ==

User -> Child2: ドロップダウン選択
Child2 -> Context: setSettings(newModelId)
Child2 -> ViewSwitch: POST /api/switch-model/ (model_id)
activate ViewSwitch

ViewSwitch -> DB: 対象モデルを有効化 (save)
note right of DB
Model.save() 内で
他モデルを自動的に無効化
end note

ViewSwitch --> Child2: 200 OK (Success Message)
deactivate ViewSwitch

Child2 -> User: 現在のモデル表示更新

@enduml